        "id": 1081638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-09T01:56:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should just move this to the constructor. RadioConfig is available much earlier than PhoneSwitcher.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 512,
